WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
Okay, the Steelers game is almost on.

2
00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:05.880
Time to fire up Steel City Game Day.

3
00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.100
Let’s check the Wire.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.300
I’m feeling good about this season.

5
00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.700
Okay, time to get the pregame picks in.

6
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.100
I wonder who’s going to get the crown today.

7
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.300
Seems like Alex is always lucky
with these kinds of things.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.500
Okay, Flash Picks are up. Who are you picking?

9
00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.400
I don’t know. The Falcons defense looks pretty tough.

10
00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:43.300
I’m not sure the Steelers are going to score
before halftime here.

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.700
Dang, it’s close to the end of the game.

12
00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:50.800
Who’s going to have the most points in our crew?

13
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.200
It better not be Alex.

14
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.800
She always wins.

15
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.400
Oh man, Alex took it.

16
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:05.300
Alex took it. I knew it.

17
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.900
Oh yes, took the crown for this game.

18
00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:15.600
I have a feeling I’m going to take it for the season.

19
00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.600
Oh well, at least we have a Steeler victory.

20
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.200
Here we go, Steelers!
